    - id: 1
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: Sunday Morning - Cell
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "You're back in your cell after breakfast. Chico is on the bunk above.
          The morning is quiet.\n\nChico gets down and sits on the floor. He pulls
          out a folded piece of paper from under his mattress.\n\nYou watch his lips.\n\n\u201CD\xEDa
          lento.\"\n\nThe rest comes too quickly, but you catch gente, aqu\xED, domingos.
          The words between them slide past you. You don't have enough. You watch
          his hands, but he isn't signing. Nothing.\n\nThen you catch,\n\n\u201CPero
          estamos aqu\xED.\u201D\n\nAqu\xED.\n\nHe gestures around.\n\nEst\xE1 bien.\n\nHe
          unfolds the paper.\n\nA poem. You can see that immediately. Spanish."
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 20
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 20
        originDialogueID: 1
        destinationConversationID: 20
        destinationDialogueID: 35
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 1700.2753
        y: 352.5777
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 2
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: You nod, or sign YES
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "You nod, or sign YES.\n\nChico nods back, like that settles something.\n\n\u201CLugar
          no construido\u201D\n\nYou watch his mouth.\n\nA place. Not built. You
          catch enough.\n\nHe walks closer to you, you can read his lips because
          he speaks slowly \u201CMuchas cosas que no te cuentan.\"\n\nYou almost
          smile.\n\nYou already know.\n\n\u201CPero puedo contarte cosas. Lo resolvemos
          juntos.\u201D\n\nYou watch him say \"juntos.\"\n\nSomething about the word
          stays with you."
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 20
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 20
        originDialogueID: 2
        destinationConversationID: 20
        destinationDialogueID: 36
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 1698.2849
        y: 566.44696
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 3
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: You're not sure how to answer
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "You're not sure how to answer\n\nChico watches you, patient.\n\n\u201COkay,
          just read the paper,\u201D he says. \u201CI\u2019ll read aloud. You follow
          with your eyes. We\u2019ll take our time. There\u2019s no rush.\u201D\n\nYou
          look at the paper.\n\nThen at him.\n\nHe doesn\u2019t know.\n\nHe sits
          down and holds the paper where you can see it clearly.\n\nYour eyes move
          across the page.\n\nEspa\xF1ol.\n\nYou understand every word.\n\n\u201CInvicto.\u201D\n\nYou
          know that word.\n\nInvicto.\n\nChico keeps talking.\n\nYou watch his mouth
          for a moment, but you don\u2019t need to.\n\nYour eyes return to the poem.\n\nInvicto.\n\nThe
          word feels different now."
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 20
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 20
        originDialogueID: 3
        destinationConversationID: 20
        destinationDialogueID: 17
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 2635.478
        y: 890.86945
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 4
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: '"Bien," dice Chico.'
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "\"Bien,\" dice Chico.\n\n\"Entonces leemos juntos, despacio. Yo leo,
          t\xFA lees. Hablamos de ello.\"\n\nSe sienta en el suelo, con el papel
          entre ustedes."
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
