        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 13
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: You give the sign for ASK? and point to yourself ME?
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "You give the sign for ASK? and point to yourself ME?\n\n\nYou look
          toward at the door of your cell.\n\nYou sign THEY SAY NO?\n\nYou look back
          at the poem.\n\nA pause.\n\nYou scrunch your face, moving your hands from
          your stomach toward your face: GET IN TROUBLE?\n\nChico shakes his head.\n\nNo
          es un problema. Es solo una solicitud.\u201D\n\nYou point around the room,
          then bring two fingers toward your eyes, scanning the space: THEY WATCH
          ME.\n\n\u201CS\xED. Vigilan a todo el mundo.\u201D\n\nAnd then, importantly,
          he doesn't promise that nothing will happen. He could say:\n\n\u201C\xBFPero
          pedir un libro? Eso no es ning\xFAn problema.\u201D\n\nYou point to yourself,
          then point toward Chico, eyebrows raised: YOU ASK?\n\nChico pauses."
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 20
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
